# Signed sessions minted for the HUD map generator.
.hud-cookies.json

# Minted session cookies and other scratch credentials.
#
# On 2026-08-31 two valid contractor session tokens reached a commit via
# `git add -A` while verifying screens over HTTP. They were signed with the same
# SESSION_SECRET production uses, and this repository is public. They expired on
# their own, but the fix is to make the mistake impossible rather than to
# remember not to make it.
#
# If you need a session to test with, mint it into one of these names.
*.cookie
*.cookies.json
.hud-cookies.json
/.*.txt
/_*.mjs
/_*.html
